        "sid": "2CH 17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "17",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoshafati mutabani w'Omukama Asa amusikira, ayebangira kurashanisa Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebigo byona bya Yuda eby'eboma abitamu abaisherukare, abata n'omu byaro bya Yuda, n'omu bigo bya Efraimu ebyo Asa ishe yabaire akwete omu ndashana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Ruhanga asingira Yehoshafati kuba akarondora ishe omu migilire eya karai. Ebihuuku bya Baali tiyabifukamiire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekyo yakozire, akakolera Ruhanga wa ishe, yakwata emihangoye, tiyarondoire Baisiraeli bandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rw'ekyo Omukama akagumisa engomaye; Yuda yona yamusholera omushoro, yagira eitunga lingi n'ekitinwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha mihango y'Omukama tiyayugaga; kandi obuju bw'aha mabanga n'ebihuuku bya Ashera omuli Yuda yabichwamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu mwaka gwa kashatu atwete, Yehoshafati atweka abamibe abhalimu Benihaili, Obadia, Zekaria, Netaneli na Mikaya kwegesa omu bigo bya Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakagenda n'Abalevita abhalimu Shemaya, Netania, Zebadia, Asaheli, Shemiramoti, Yehonatani, Adonia, Tobia na Tobadonia. Kandi Abalevita aba bakaba bainamu abakuhani, nibo Elishama na Yehoramu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bhakaba baina Ekitabo ky'Amateka g'Omukama, begesa Amateka ago omuli Yuda. Ebigo byona bya Yuda babirabarabamu begesa abantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Engoma zona z'ensi ezabaire zataine Yuda zitina Omukama, tizazilize kutabalira Yehoshafati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abafilisiti abandi baletera Yehoshafati egabo, bataho n'efeza y'omushoro. Abaarabu nabo kwakwo bamuletera empaya z'entaama 7,700 n'empaya z'embuzi 7,700. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpora mpora Yehoshafati agenda nagira amani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuli Yuda ayombekamu ebigo by'eboma n'eby'obuhanika. Omuli Yerusalemu omwo hakaba ainamu abaisherukare emanzi z'amani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Egi niyo mitekere eyo yabatekeire kuhonderana n'amahiga gabo: Abaisherukare 300,000 bakaruga omu mahiga g'oruganda rwa Yuda; mukuru wabo hakaba ali Adina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayahonderaga Adina omu bukuru hakaba ali Yehohanani; ogwo hakaba aina 280,000. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owa kashatu hakaba ali Amasia eya Zikiri; ogwo hakaba aina abaisherukare emanzi 200,000. Amasia hakaba ayebugire bwebuga kukolera Omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisherukale ab'omu mahiga ag'oruganda rwa Benjamini bakaba bali 200,000 abaina amata n'engabo; bakaba nibakulirwa Eliada omwisherukare kiranganwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eliada yakuratwaga Yehozabadi, ayabaire aina abaisherukare 180,000 abakwete ebikwato by'endashana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba nibo balindaga Omukama Yehoshafati, kandi ab'omukama yabaire atekire omu bigo by'eboma ebya Yuda batabulimu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
